  "discussion": "Dictation _MUST_ be disabled on Intel based Macs as the feature On Device Dictation is only available on Apple Silicon devices. When enabled on Apple Silicon Macs, on device dictation _MUST_ be enabled as well to prevent data from being sent off device.\n",
